{
  "pageWidth": 595.28,
  "pageHeight": 841.89,
  "lines": [
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Adaptive Marker Panels for Early Sepsis Detection in Rural",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 119.04625,
      "width": 448.00000000000006,
      "fontSize": 17.5,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Emergency Cohorts: A Multicentre Registry Study",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 141.54625,
      "width": 379.1025,
      "fontSize": 17.5,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Ruth Aluko, MD · Nils Halloran, PhD · Petra Sørensen, MD · Joy Adeyemi, MPH · Luca Marchetti, MD",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 168.8332,
      "width": 429.2912,
      "fontSize": 10.4,
      "font": "Times-Italic"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Northfield Rural Health Collaborative — Department of Emergency Medicine, Ellsworth Institute, Brindle Bay",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 185.03130000000002,
      "width": 410.9424000000001,
      "fontSize": 8.6,
      "font": "Helvetica"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Journal of Applied Clinical Registries · Vol. 12, No. 4 · 2024 · pp. 118–131",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 200.2531,
      "width": 264.2614,
      "fontSize": 8.2,
      "font": "Helvetica"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Abstract",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 244.60049999999998,
      "width": 40.931,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Background. Rural emergency departments face delayed escalation for sepsis because confirmatory laboratory",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 261.9441,
      "width": 450.29939999999993,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "results frequently arrive after the point at which antibiotics would have been administered. Interval time, rather",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 276.34409999999997,
      "width": 451.8396,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "than diagnostic uncertainty, appears to be the dominant contributor to preventable harm in these settings.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 290.74409999999995,
      "width": 426.5028,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Objective. We evaluated whether an adaptive sepsis marker panel used as a triage gate reduced",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 311.1440999999999,
      "width": 385.1622,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "time-to-therapeutic intervention in a multicentre rural cohort.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 325.5440999999999,
      "width": 249.42059999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Design, Setting, and Participants. We performed a retrospective registry study across eleven rural emergency",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 345.94409999999993,
      "width": 442.14959999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "departments between March 2021 and October 2023, using prospectively captured timestamps from the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 360.3440999999999,
      "width": 422.535,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "electronic record.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 374.7440999999999,
      "width": 71.3694,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Results. A total of 14,882 adults were included. Time-to-therapeutic intervention fell by 31% (95% CI 24% to",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 395.1440999999999,
      "width": 448.341,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "37%). Marker-panel gating was associated with lower 28-day in-hospital mortality in the adjusted analysis",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 409.5440999999999,
      "width": 433.85699999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "(adjusted hazard ratio 0.81, 95% CI 0.74 to 0.89).",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 423.9440999999999,
      "width": 202.55159999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Conclusions. Adaptive marker panels may permit earlier escalation in settings where confirmatory testing is",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 444.3440999999999,
      "width": 439.52819999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "delayed. Confirmation in prospectively governed cohorts is required before the approach is recommended as a",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 458.7440999999999,
      "width": 449.1978,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "standard of care.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 473.14409999999987,
      "width": 67.68719999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "1. Introduction",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 514.6805999999999,
      "width": 84.8364,
      "fontSize": 13.2,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Sepsis mortality in rural settings is driven less by an absence of clinical knowledge than by the interval between",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 535.5441,
      "width": 455.7563999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "suspicion and intervention. Rural emergency departments depend on serial lactate measurements and",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 549.9440999999999,
      "width": 411.3966,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "blood-culture results that, in many hospitals, return after the moment at which antibiotics would have been",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 564.3440999999999,
      "width": 434.25479999999993,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "given. The literature on sepsis bundles has focused on which interventions improve survival; comparatively little",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 578.7440999999999,
      "width": 458.19419999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "work has addressed the organisational delay that prevents them being applied.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 593.1440999999999,
      "width": 317.3832,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We designed an adaptive panel that re-evaluates a patient when the first marker set is inconclusive, rather than",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 613.5441,
      "width": 447.94319999999993,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "waiting for a complete laboratory panel. The panel is deliberately simple: three threshold rules applied at triage,",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 627.9440999999999,
      "width": 455.79720000000003,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "with an explicit re-evaluation trigger. Prior work on triage gating in general populations suggests a reduction in",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 642.3440999999999,
      "width": 452.74739999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "time-to-antibiotics of roughly one third, and it is this prior literature that our own estimates are, in part, intended",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 656.7440999999999,
      "width": 457.2864,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "to extend to rural practice.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 671.1440999999999,
      "width": 107.20199999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Three questions structure the remainder of this report. First, does marker-panel gating alter time-to-therapeutic",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 691.5441,
      "width": 450.90119999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "intervention in a rural cohort in which confirmatory testing is delayed? Second, is any such association",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 705.9440999999999,
      "width": 419.33219999999994,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "detectable after adjustment for the case-mix differences that dominate rural emergency admissions? Third, can",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 720.3440999999999,
      "width": 450.17699999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "the association be separated from the shared-data and shared-review lineages that complicate much of the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 734.7440999999999,
      "width": 430.04220000000004,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "registry literature?",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 749.1440999999999,
      "width": 74.9088,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "2. Methods",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 772.6806,
      "width": 62.3304,
      "fontSize": 13.2,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "2.1 Design, setting, and reporting",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 86.40050000000001,
      "width": 155.331,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This is a retrospective cohort study drawn from eleven rural emergency departments in four health regions.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 103.7441,
      "width": 435.34619999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Reporting follows the RECORD statement for routinely collected health data. The study protocol, analysis plan,",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 118.14410000000001,
      "width": 457.1027999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "and the derived dataset specification were registered before extraction.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 132.54410000000001,
      "width": 287.1402,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "2.2 Cohort definition",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 153.60049999999998,
      "width": 97.81199999999998,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Sampling was restricted to adult admissions coded with a suspected-infection diagnosis at triage, following the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 170.9441,
      "width": 452.08439999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "eligibility rules published by Lee et al. (2020). We applied the same exclusion logic as that report — no",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 185.3441,
      "width": 421.97399999999993,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "confirmed infection at 48 hours, no admission from a non-emergency setting, and no recorded care limitation at",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 199.7441,
      "width": 454.98119999999994,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "triage.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 214.1441,
      "width": 25.7754,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The index admission was the first emergency presentation with a suspected-infection code. Encounters",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 234.5441,
      "width": 418.7406,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "transferred between the participating hospitals were linked on a pseudonymous encounter identifier and counted",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 248.9441,
      "width": 457.0314,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "once, at the receiving site.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 263.34409999999997,
      "width": 106.25339999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "2.3 Outcome capture and risk adjustment",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 284.40049999999997,
      "width": 195.349,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We reused the outcome-capture interval and the risk-adjustment covariates defined by Okonjo et al. (2019),",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 301.74409999999995,
      "width": 437.2841999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "because those definitions align with the registry exports available at all eleven sites. Covariates were derived",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 316.1440999999999,
      "width": 441.4253999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "from structured fields only; no free-text narrative was read.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 330.5440999999999,
      "width": 240.75059999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "2.4 Statistical analysis",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 351.60049999999995,
      "width": 102.98200000000001,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Time-to-therapeutic intervention was defined as the interval from triage decision to the administration of a",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 368.94409999999993,
      "width": 433.48979999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "guideline-concordant antimicrobial, truncated at 180 minutes. We used a Cox proportional-hazards model with",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 383.3440999999999,
      "width": 451.57439999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "site-level random intercepts, and a two-part model for the time component to accommodate the mass at the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 397.7440999999999,
      "width": 435.4686,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "truncation boundary.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 412.14409999999987,
      "width": 84.3234,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "3. Results",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 88.8806,
      "width": 54.26520000000001,
      "fontSize": 13.2,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Between March 2021 and October 2023, 19,431",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 113.7441,
      "width": 196.5948,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "eligible presentations were recorded across the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 128.1441,
      "width": 190.62779999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "eleven sites, of whom 14,882 met all cohort criteria.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 142.54410000000001,
      "width": 212.34359999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Site volume ranged from 604 to 3,102 eligible",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 156.94410000000002,
      "width": 188.48579999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "presentations. Baseline characteristics were",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 171.34410000000003,
      "width": 177.31679999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "materially similar between gated and ungated",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 185.74410000000003,
      "width": 185.44619999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "presentations, with the largest differences in age and",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 200.14410000000004,
      "width": 213.71040000000002,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "systolic blood pressure at triage.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 214.54410000000004,
      "width": 131.73299999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Registry cohorts in comparable settings have",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 234.9441,
      "width": 182.784,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "reported a marked reduction in time-to-antibiotics",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 249.3441,
      "width": 203.58180000000002,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "when marker panels are used to gate escalation",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 263.7441,
      "width": 191.60699999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "(Mehra et al., 2020). Our own estimates are",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 278.1441,
      "width": 177.63299999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "consistent with that reported direction of effect, and",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 292.54409999999996,
      "width": 211.06859999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "the mechanism assumed in both analyses — that an",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 306.94409999999993,
      "width": 210.21179999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "earlier provisional marker result releases a decision",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 321.3440999999999,
      "width": 209.355,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "before confirmatory testing completes — is the",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 335.7440999999999,
      "width": 192.43319999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "same.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 350.14409999999987,
      "width": 23.511,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "3.1 Primary outcome",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 370.63319999999993,
      "width": 88.0984,
      "fontSize": 10.4,
      "font": "Times-Italic"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Median time-to-therapeutic intervention was 96",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 386.9440999999999,
      "width": 194.64659999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "minutes in gated presentations and 138 minutes in",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 401.34409999999986,
      "width": 204.22439999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "ungated presentations. The adjusted hazard ratio for",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 415.74409999999983,
      "width": 211.3644,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "time-to-intervention was 0.69 (95% CI 0.66 to 0.72).",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 430.1440999999998,
      "width": 215.34239999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "3.2 Secondary outcomes",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 450.63319999999993,
      "width": 101.3792,
      "fontSize": 10.4,
      "font": "Times-Italic"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "28-day in-hospital mortality was 6.1% in gated and",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 466.9440999999999,
      "width": 208.92659999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "7.4% in ungated presentations (adjusted hazard ratio",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 481.34409999999986,
      "width": 213.82259999999994,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "0.81, 95% CI 0.74 to 0.89). Intensive-care admission",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 495.74409999999983,
      "width": 215.46479999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "within 72 hours was 3.9% and 4.6% respectively.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 510.1440999999998,
      "width": 200.53199999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A national analysis by Aldridge et al. (2021)",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 530.5441,
      "width": 181.31519999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "reported a similar association between marker-panel",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 544.9440999999999,
      "width": 212.98619999999994,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "gating and time-to-therapeutic intervention in a",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 559.3440999999999,
      "width": 192.7188,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "shared registry cohort. We did not have access to that",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 573.7440999999999,
      "width": 216.4848,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "analysis and could not independently reproduce its",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 588.1440999999999,
      "width": 206.80499999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "covariate specification.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 602.5440999999998,
      "width": 93.993,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "3.3 Cohort flow and missing data",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 623.0331999999999,
      "width": 139.2664,
      "fontSize": 10.4,
      "font": "Times-Italic"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Screening logs were available for 19,431 of 21,406",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 639.3440999999999,
      "width": 208.31459999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "eligible presentations; 1,975 could not be reconciled",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 653.7440999999999,
      "width": 213.3228,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "against the registry extract and were excluded before",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 668.1440999999999,
      "width": 215.0364,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "analysis. Missing laboratory values were",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 682.5440999999998,
      "width": 166.0356,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "uncommon: fewer than 2% of presentations lacked",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 696.9440999999998,
      "width": 206.99879999999996,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "an initial lactate, and fewer than 4% lacked a",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 711.3440999999998,
      "width": 182.9064,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "documented systolic blood pressure.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 725.7440999999998,
      "width": 148.4508,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Time of presentation was missing in 0.8% of",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 113.7441,
      "width": 182.5596,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "records. We did not impute missing covariate values;",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 128.1441,
      "width": 215.21999999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "complete-case analysis was used throughout, and the",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 142.54410000000001,
      "width": 215.47499999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "primary result was unchanged under multiple",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 156.94410000000002,
      "width": 184.88519999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "imputation with chained equations as a post hoc",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 171.34410000000003,
      "width": 195.7686,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "check.",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 185.74410000000003,
      "width": 26.336399999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "3.4 Protocol fidelity",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 206.2332,
      "width": 82.81519999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.4,
      "font": "Times-Italic"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Panel documentation was complete in 88% of gated",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 222.54410000000001,
      "width": 211.31339999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "presentations. Incomplete documentation clustered",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 236.94410000000002,
      "width": 207.36599999999999,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "at three sites that introduced gating late in the",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 251.34410000000003,
      "width": 185.793,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "recruitment window, and the primary estimate",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 265.7441,
      "width": 187.7514,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "excluding those sites was 0.72 (95% CI 0.68 to",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 280.1441,
      "width": 191.83139999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "0.76).",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 294.54409999999996,
      "width": 23.796599999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "No interim analysis was performed and no",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 314.9441,
      "width": 173.26739999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "outcome-adaptive design element was used. The",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 329.34409999999997,
      "width": 197.03339999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "analysis plan, the derived dataset specification, and",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 343.74409999999995,
      "width": 208.44719999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "the statistical code were frozen before the first",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 358.1440999999999,
      "width": 188.72039999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "outcome comparison was run.",
      "x": 310.64,
      "y": 372.5440999999999,
      "width": 122.27759999999998,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "3.5 Supplementary analyses",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 88.8806,
      "width": 156.5784,
      "fontSize": 13.2,
      "font": "Times-Bold"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "Results were stable across all prespecified sensitivity analyses. Restricting to presentations with a complete first",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 109.7441,
      "width": 456.29699999999997,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "marker set moved the adjusted hazard ratio from 0.69 to 0.71. Excluding the three largest-volume sites moved it",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 124.14410000000001,
      "width": 456.13379999999995,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "to 0.70. Neither change alters the interpretation of the primary result.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 138.54410000000001,
      "width": 281.2956,
      "fontSize": 10.2,
      "font": "Times-Roman"
    },
    {
