    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "Figure 1. Distribution of time-to-therapeutic intervention by month of presentation, gated (upper) and ungated (lower) presentations.",
      "x": 68,
      "y": 460.7748999999999,
      "width": 451.15979999999996,
      "fontSize": 7.8,
      "font": "Helvetica"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
